error[SCXML013]: event descriptors are whitespace-separated, not comma-separated
 --> tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx:5:24
  |
5 |     <transition event="finish, abort" target="don"/>
  |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ comma in event descriptor list
  |
  = note: `event` is a whitespace-separated list of descriptors (`a`, `a.b`, `a.*`, `*`); commas and other punctuation never match
  = help: replace commas with spaces; each descriptor is matched independently
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §3.12.1 Event Descriptors
help: replace commas with spaces
