warning[LINT022]: element `<c:mark>` in an unbound namespace has no effect
 --> tests/ui/multi-diagnostic-ordering.scx:6:6
  |
4 |   <state id="ready">
  |    ----- not executable content: `<state>` runs no custom action
5 |     <transition event="finish, abort" target="don"/>
6 |     <c:mark value="not-an-integer"/>
  |      ^^^^^^ namespace `urn:example:custom`
  |
  = note: SCXML 1.0 allows attributes and elements from other namespaces on and in its elements (the W3C schema's `##other` wildcards), and the processor executes none of them: only a package that binds the namespace (its schema and validator) reads them, and no extension package or registered schema binds this one
  = help: bind the namespace's package (`--extension-package MANIFEST.json`) or register its schema (`--schema URI=PATH`), or remove the element if it is a leftover
help: remove `<c:mark>`
  |
6 -     <c:mark value="not-an-integer"/>

